      "rationale": "Pack D reframed on 2026-07-21 after a deep code-tree trace established that the shared integrity primitives already exist in the d1-intents/ family (database.ts, history-events.ts, intent-context.ts, access.ts) plus mutation-receipts.ts and project-component-attachment-retention.ts. The v1 framing (extract MutationIntent primitives from rows.ts) was wrong: rows.ts is a consumer, not the source. The v2 work routes the 9 forked write paths through the existing primitives. The single biggest integrity hole discovered is the activity_event_outbox row silently dropped by 5 forks that hand-roll the estimate_sheet_events INSERT — UNIT-001 closes it first. The v1 unit files (extraction-from-rows framing) were deleted; the v2 units (001 outbox, 002 intent/receipt, 003 revision guard, 004 strict access) address the real gaps. See references/primitive-map.md for the full primitive surface and fork gap matrix."
    }
